# Files autoformat and autolint should skip completely.
#
# Each non-comment non-blank line is a bash glob pattern (supports
# `*`, `?`, `[...]`; no `**`, no negations) matched against the file
# path passed to autoformat/autolint. A match → the script exits 0
# without running any tool.
#
# Prefer phase-specific files (`format-ignore`, `spell-ignore`, `tool-ignore`,
# and `schema-ignore`) for new policy so skipping formatting or spelling does
# not accidentally suppress schema validation.
